0 ADN 0
E
plaque~
.
                             * THE TRIFORCE *
                             ----------------

The greatest and most magical artifact in Hyrule's history
was the Triforce.  The Triforce is shaped like three triangles and are
connected into the shape of a bigger triangle.  The same three gods who
created Hyrule created the Triforce.

Not wishing to leave Hyrule without some kind of mystic protection, the gods
created a parallel world known as the Golden Land, and there the gods hid the
Triforce, the great artifact granted any and all wishes of anyone's.  There was
a flaw in the design of the Triforce however- it could not judge good wishes
from bad.  The Hylians, being greedy and vain as most mortals tend to be,
desperately searched for the Power of Gold, but most never returned or came
back empty-handed.

Finally Ganondorf Dragmire, King of Thieves, found the Triforce.  He wished
to rule the world, but the Triforce knew of only one world- the Golden Land.
So, Ganon (which Ganondorf came to be known) twisted the Golden Land into
the Dark World, a place of pure evil.  When Ganon started to try to take
over Hyrule, it was harder than he expected.  Soon a young lad, Link,
arrived and defeated the Prince of Darkness and claimed the Triforce.  He
brought the Triforce to Hyrule and restored her to her former glory, and the
Dark World disappeared without the artifact.

Over the years, it was decided to split the Triforce into three separate
triangles- the Triforce of Wisdom, the Triforce of Power, and the Triforce
of Courage (they were named after the gods who created them).  His was most
likely done to distribute the power so no one held supreme power.  The Triforce pieces'
names described their attributes- Wisdom gave the holder supreme power of
attributes.  Power gave the holder the power to do much more damage then normally
possible.  Courage gave the holder the power to withstand fights much longer then
usually possible.  When combined, the Triforce has all the separate powers in one,
along with new powers of its own.  Nevertheless, the Triforces did have
their drawbacks- if misused they would bring many evils.  So, if Power were
used without the Wisdom to control it the user would be corrupt and slowly
turn satanic.  This transformation is called "The Price of Power".

It is said that only the holder of the complete Triforce can gain access to the
Temple of Time and attain the most powerful weapon in Hyrule, the Master
Sword.


- There are some small symbols carved in the plaque by hand...  VII...
III...  IX.
