#30469
The Enchanted Courtyard~
You are standing in the most beautiful room in Hyrule.  The colors in
this room seem to shift and change with the blink of an eye.  As you look
upward, the night sky is perfectly clear, and it seems as if you can see
forever up into the stars.  As you are watching, a shooting star flies by,
and you make a wish...  Knowing it will come true.  You feel so secure and
safe here...  You never want to leave.  Behind a small bench, there is a
plaque...  Covered by beautiful roses.  A single rose lies on the ground
here, glowing brightly.
~
